# Supabase project used by the public signup form (MKT-1).
# Same Supabase project the CACFP Free app (freecacfp.com) uses -- publishable/
# anon key only. NEVER put a service-role key in this app; it is a public
# static site with no server runtime to keep one secret.
# These are NEXT_PUBLIC_* values: Next.js inlines them at build time for this
# static export, so they must be set in Netlify's build environment, not just
# here.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
